flowchart TD
    PR[Pull Request Created] --> Gate[1. PR Gatekeepers]
    Gate -->|Pass| Parallel{Automated Checks}
    Gate -->|Fail| Block[❌ Block PR: CI Halted]

    subgraph CI_Quality [Automated Quality & Security Gates]
        Parallel --> Lint[2. Linters & Formatters]
        Parallel --> Build[3. Build & Compilation Gate]
        Parallel --> Tests[4. Tests & Coverage Gate]
        Parallel --> CodeQuality[5. Code Quality & Security\n- CodeQL static rules\n- Secret & Dep scanning]
        Parallel --> Docs[6. Documentation Drift Gate]
    end

    CI_Quality -->|All Automated Checks Pass| ReviewStage{Review Stage}

    subgraph Code_Review [Code Review Stage]
        ReviewStage --> CopilotReview[6. GitHub Copilot Code Review\n- AI semantic & architecture review\n- Actionable diff suggestions]
        CopilotReview --> HumanReview[7. Human Peer Review\n- Business logic & final sign-off]
    end

    HumanReview --> Merge([🚀 Merge])
